  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『フルメタル・パニック！ Invisible Victory』11話12話で大活躍した、ウルズチームの漆黒の隊長機「M9Dファルケ」を一部新規金型で立体化！",
      "en": "\"Full Metal Panic! Invisible Victory's jet-black captain machine \" M9D Falke \", which played a big role in episodes 11 and 12 of \" Invisible Victory\", is now three-dimensional with some new molds!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部、肩部、脚部パーツは新規金型で造形。新規オリジナル武器も付属。",
      "en": "• The head, shoulders, and leg parts are sculpted using new molds. New original weapons are also included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• M9Dファルケの特徴的な単分子カッター「クリムゾンエッジ」が追加武装として付属。",
      "en": "• M9D Falke's characteristic single molecule cutter \"Crimson Edge\" is included as an additional weapon."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りのHG1/60 アーバレストVer.IV（緊急展開ブースター装備仕様）の緊急展開ブースターを装備できる。",
      "en": "• Can be equipped with the emergency deployment booster of the separately sold HG1/60 Arbalest Ver.IV (Equipped with emergency deployment booster)."
    }
  ],
